From: ReArc Authors
Subject: [PATCH] P-TAB-001 export the bulk extension install ABI (ABI 1.53)

tab/073 declared ReArcProfileInstallExtensions and
ReArcProfileLoadUnpackedExtension with REARC_ENGINE_EXPORT but did not list
them in framework.exports/framework.order. The component dev build exports
them anyway; the non-component release framework does not, and
build-engine-release.sh refuses it. Export-list lines only.

Last rebased: 2026-11-09 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.74 (d331de35ca).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/chrome/app/framework.exports b/chrome/app/framework.exports
index 9a5c828b66..2ca63d8547 100644
--- a/chrome/app/framework.exports
+++ b/chrome/app/framework.exports
@@ -102,6 +102,8 @@ _ReArcEngineSetZoomCallback
 _ReArcTabGetZoomFactor
 _ReArcTabGetThemeColor
 _ReArcEngineSetThemeColorCallback
+_ReArcProfileInstallExtensions
+_ReArcProfileLoadUnpackedExtension
 _ReArcTabSetZoomFactor
 _ReArcTabGetDocumentIdentity
 _ReArcTabEvaluateScript2
diff --git a/chrome/app/framework.order b/chrome/app/framework.order
index b9b8811de5..5b6763aeb0 100644
--- a/chrome/app/framework.order
+++ b/chrome/app/framework.order
@@ -113,6 +113,8 @@ _ReArcEngineSetZoomCallback
 _ReArcTabGetZoomFactor
 _ReArcTabGetThemeColor
 _ReArcEngineSetThemeColorCallback
+_ReArcProfileInstallExtensions
+_ReArcProfileLoadUnpackedExtension
 _ReArcTabSetZoomFactor
 _ReArcTabGetDocumentIdentity
 _ReArcTabEvaluateScript2
